I've written the full review to `docs/hoplite/c5_d084_2026-11-07/review_SONNET.md`. It is the only file changed, and it is untracked and uncommitted.

**Sync:** `git fetch origin` worked. `git pull --ff-only origin main` reported "Already up to date". HEAD is `fc31b0719f3cd0ad1a9c18b326baf7426c12103e`.

**Limit on checking:** the P0 source data (`data/external/f5_pairs_v3*.jsonl`) is not in the repo or sandbox. I could not re-run the audit or read the source text for `04709`, `03801`, `03992` or the 5 flipped pairs. Where I derived a number from the audit JSON instead of reading it from an artifact, the report marks it as derived.

All v2 numbers below are hypothetical audit results. D-083 strict stands: `selected_step = null`, with pilot300 as fallback and no product approval. No gate change is approved.

